type="local"
addr="grayson-2018">An introduction to univalent foundations for mathematicians</fr:link>.
            On p.20, the so-called "'resizing' rules" are mentioned and the
            consistency of such a system is left open.
            Apparently, this is still open as of
            <fr:link
href="https://benediktahrens.gitlab.io/talks/HTT-UF-Leeds2019.pdf"
type="external">2019</fr:link>.
